        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Advanced form styling - MDN</title>\n<style>\n    :root {\n        --text-main: #1b1b1b;\n        --text-muted: #666;\n        --link-color: #0052cc;\n        --bg-main: #ffffff;\n        --bg-muted: #f9f9f9;\n        --border-color: #e0e0e0;\n        --active-bg: #fff4e6;\n        --active-border: #d76e42;\n        --code-bg: #f0f4f8;\n        --note-bg: #f0f6ff;\n        --font-sans: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \"Open Sans\", \"Helvetica Neue\", sans-serif;\n        --font-mono: ui-monospace, Menlo, Monaco, \"Cascadia Mono\", \"Segoe UI Mono\", \"Roboto Mono\", \"Oxygen Mono\", \"Ubuntu Monospace\", \"Source Code Pro\", \"Fira Mono\", \"Droid Sans Mono\", \"Courier New\", monospace;\n    }\n\n    body {\n        font-family: var(--font-sans);\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 0;\n        color: var(--text-main);\n        line-height: 1.5;\n        background-color: var(--bg-main);\n    }\n\n    a {\n        text-decoration: none;\n        color: inherit;\n    }\n\n    a:hover {\n        text-decoration: underline;\n    }\n\n    .link {\n        color: var(--link-color);\n        text-decoration: underline;\n    }\n\n    /* Top Banner */\n    .top-banner {\n        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n        padding: 8px 20px;\n        position: relative;\n        font-size: 13px;\n        display: flex;\n        flex-direction: column;\n        align-items: center;\n    }\n    .top-banner-content {\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        gap: 15px;\n    }\n    .mongo-logo {\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        gap: 5px;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        color: #00684a;\n    }\n    .mongo-logo span {\n        font-size: 16px;\n    }\n    .top-banner button {\n        background-color: #00684a;\n        color: white;\n        border: none;\n        padding: 6px 12px;\n        border-radius: 4px;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        cursor: pointer;\n    }\n    .ad-badge-top {\n        position: absolute;\n        top: 5px;\n        right: 20px;\n        border: 1px solid #ccc;\n        font-size: 10px;\n        padding: 1px 4px;\n        color: var(--text-muted);\n    }\n    .ad-link-top {\n        position: absolute;\n        bottom: 5px;\n        right: 20px;\n        font-size: 11px;\n    }\n    .ad-link-top a {\n        color: var(--text-muted);\n        text-decoration: underline;\n    }\n\n    /* Header */\n    .main-header {\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: space-between;\n        align-items: center;\n        padding: 15px 20px;\n        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n    }\n    .logo {\n        font-size: 24px;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        letter-spacing: -0.5px;\n    }\n    .logo span {\n        color: #8cb4ff;\n        margin-right: 5px;\n        font-weight: normal;\n    }\n    .main-nav {\n        display: flex;\n        gap: 20px;\n        font-weight: 500;\n        font-size: 15px;\n    }\n    .main-nav a {\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        gap: 4px;\n    }\n    .main-nav span {\n        font-size: 10px;\n        color: var(--text-muted);\n    }\n    .header-actions {\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        gap: 15px;\n    }\n    .search-bar {\n        border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n        border-radius: 20px;\n        padding: 6px 15px;\n        width: 120px;\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: flex-end;\n        align-items: center;\n        color: var(--text-muted);\n    }\n    .icon-btn {\n        font-size: 18px;\n        color: var(--text-main);\n        cursor: pointer;\n    }\n\n    /* Breadcrumb Bar */\n    .breadcrumb-bar {\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: space-between;\n        align-items: center;\n        padding: 12px 20px;\n        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n        font-size: 14px;\n        background-color: var(--bg-muted);\n    }\n    .breadcrumbs {\n        color: var(--text-muted);\n    }\n    .breadcrumbs strong {\n        color: var(--text-main);\n        font-weight: 500;\n    }\n    .page-settings {\n        display: flex;\n        gap: 20px;\n        align-items: center;\n    }\n    .page-settings span {\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        gap: 5px;\n        cursor: pointer;\n    }\n\n    /* Main Layout */\n    .main-container {\n        display: grid;\n        grid-template-columns: 260px 1fr 260px;\n        gap: 40px;\n        padding: 30px 20px;\n        max-width: 1400px;\n        margin: 0 auto;\n    }\n\n    /* Left Sidebar */\n    .left-sidebar {\n        font-size: 14px;\n    }\n    .filter-box {\n        position: relative;\n        margin-bottom: 20px;\n    }\n    .filter-box input {\n        width: 100%;\n        padding: 8px 10px 8px 30px;\n        border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n        border-radius: 20px;\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n        font-size: 14px;\n    }\n    .filter-icon {\n        position: absolute;\n        left: 10px;\n        top: 50%;\n        transform: translateY(-50%);\n        color: var(--text-muted);\n    }\n    .nav-list {\n        list-style: none;\n        padding: 0;\n        margin: 0;\n    }\n    .nav-list > li {\n        padding: 6px 0;\n        cursor: pointer;\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n    }\n    .nav-list .greyed {\n        color: #999;\n    }\n    .section-title {\n        font-weight: bold;\n        margin-top: 25px !important;\n        margin-bottom: 10px !important;\n        font-size: 15px;\n    }\n    .sub-list {\n        list-style: none;\n        padding-left: 15px;\n        margin: 5px 0 5px 10px;\n        border-left: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n        width: 100%;\n    }\n    .sub-list li {\n        padding: 6px 10px;\n        color: var(--text-main);\n    }\n    .sub-list li.active {\n        background-color: var(--active-bg);\n        border-left: 3px solid var(--active-border);\n        margin-left: -1px;\n        font-weight: 500;\n    }\n    .nav-arrow {\n        margin-right: 8px;\n        font-size: 10px;\n        color: var(--text-muted);\n    }\n\n    /* Center Content */\n    .content {\n        min-width: 0; /* Prevents grid blowout */\n    }\n    .content h1 {\n        font-size: 40px;\n        margin-top: 0;\n        margin-bottom: 20px;\n        font-weight: 500;\n        letter-spacing: -0.5px;\n    }\n    .article-nav {\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: space-between;\n        border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n        padding: 12px 0;\n        margin-bottom: 25px;\n        font-size: 14px;\n    }\n    .article-nav a {\n        color: var(--link-color);\n    }\n    .info-table {\n        width: 100%;\n        border-collapse: collapse;\n        margin-bottom: 25px;\n        font-size: 15px;\n    }\n    .info-table th, .info-table td {\n        border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n        padding: 12px 15px;\n        text-align: left;\n        vertical-align: top;\n    }\n    .info-table th {\n        width: 120px;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        background-color: var(--bg-muted);\n    }\n    .content p {\n        margin-bottom: 16px;\n        font-size: 16px;\n    }\n    .content ul {\n        margin-bottom: 20px;\n        padding-left: 25px;\n        font-size: 16px;\n    }\n    .content li {\n        margin-bottom: 8px;\n    }\n    code {\n        background-color: var(--code-bg);\n        padding: 2px 6px;\n        border-radius: 4px;\n        font-family: var(--font-mono);\n        font-size: 14px;\n        color: var(--text-main);\n    }\n    a code {\n        color: var(--link-color);\n        text-decoration: underline;\n    }\n    .note-box {\n        background-color: var(--note-bg);\n        padding: 15px 20px;\n        margin: 15px 0;\n        border-radius: 4px;\n        font-size: 15px;\n        display: flex;\n        gap: 10px;\n        align-items: flex-start;\n    }\n    .note-icon {\n        color: var(--link-color);\n        font-size: 18px;\n        margin-top: 2px;\n    }\n    .content h2 {\n        font-size: 28px;\n        margin-top: 45px;\n        margin-bottom: 20px;\n        font-weight: 500;\n        letter-spacing: -0.5px;\n    }\n    .content h2 code {\n        font-size: 28px;\n        background: none;\n        padding: 0;\n        font-weight: 500;\n    }\n\n    /* Right Sidebar */\n    .right-sidebar {\n        font-size: 14px;\n    }\n    .right-sidebar h3 {\n        font-size: 18px;\n        margin-top: 0;\n        margin-bottom: 15px;\n        font-weight: 500;\n    }\n    .toc-list {\n        list-style: none;\n        padding: 0;\n        margin: 0 0 30px 0;\n        border-left: 2px solid var(--border-color);\n    }\n    .toc-list li {\n        padding: 8px 15px;\n        cursor: pointer;\n        line-height: 1.4;\n    }\n    .toc-list li.active {\n        border-left: 2px solid var(--active-border);\n        margin-left: -2px;\n        background-color: var(--active-bg);\n    }\n    \n    .ad-box {\n        background-color: #0052cc;\n        color: white;\n        padding: 20px;\n        border-radius: 8px;\n        position: relative;\n        text-align: left;\n        margin-bottom: 5px;\n    }\n    .ad-badge-small {\n        position: absolute;\n        top: 8px;\n        right: 8px;\n        border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.5);\n        font-size: 10px;\n        padding: 1px 4px;\n        border-radius: 2px;\n    }\n    .ad-logo {\n        font-size: 28px;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        font-style: italic;\n        margin-bottom: 20px;\n        margin-top: 10px;\n        letter-spacing: -1px;\n    }\n    .ad-text {\n        font-size: 13px;\n        margin-bottom: 20px;\n        line-height: 1.4;\n    }\n    .ad-btn {\n        background: transparent;\n        color: white;\n        border: 1px solid white;\n        padding: 6px 15px;\n        border-radius: 20px;\n        cursor: pointer;\n        font-size: 13px;\n        display: inline-flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        gap: 5px;\n    }\n    .ad-link-small {\n        text-align: left;\n        font-size: 11px;\n    }\n    .ad-link-small a {\n        color: var(--text-muted);\n        text-decoration: underline;\n    }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"top-banner\">\n    <div class=\"ad-badge-top\">AD</div>\n    <div class=\"top-banner-content\">\n        <div class=\"mongo-logo\"><span>&#127811;</span> MongoDB</div>\n        <span>Simplify infrastructure with MongoDB Atlas, the most popular modern database.</span>\n        <button>Get started for free</button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"ad-link-top\"><a href=\"#\">Don't want to see ads?</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<header class=\"main-header\">\n    <div class=\"logo\"><span>//</span> mdn_</div>\n    <nav class=\"main-nav\">\n        <a href=\"#\">HTML <span>&#9662;</span></a>\n        <a href=\"#\">CSS <span>&#9662;</span></a>\n        <a href=\"#\">JavaScript <span>&#9662;</span></a>\n        <a href=\"#\">Web APIs <span>&#9662;</span></a>\n        <a href=\"#\">All <span>&#9662;</span></a>\n        <a href=\"#\">Learn <span>&#9662;</span></a>\n        <a href=\"#\">Tools <span>&#9662;</span></a>\n        <a href=\"#\">About <span>&#9662;</span></a>\n        <a href=\"#\">Blog</a>\n    </nav>\n    <div class=\"header-actions\">\n        <div class=\"search-bar\">\n            <span>&#128269;</span>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"icon-btn\">&#10142;</span>\n    </div>\n</header>\n\n<div class=\"breadcrumb-bar\">\n    <div class=\"breadcrumbs\">\n        Learn &gt; Extension modules &gt; Web forms &gt; <strong>Advanced form styling</strong>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"page-settings\">\n        <span>&#9681; Theme</span>\n        <span>&#25991; English (US)</span>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"main-container\">\n    <aside class=\"left-sidebar\">\n        <div class=\"filter-box\">\n            <span class=\"filter-icon\">&#9842;</span>\n            <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Filter\">\n        </div>\n        <ul class=\"nav-list\">\n            <li class=\"greyed\"><span class=\"nav-arrow\">&gt;</span> CSS text styling</li>\n            <li><strong><span class=\"nav-arrow\">&gt;</span> CSS layout</strong></li>\n            <li><span class=\"nav-arrow\">&gt;</span> Dynamic scripting with JavaScript</li>\n            <li><span class=\"nav-arrow\">&gt;</span> JavaScript frameworks and libraries</li>\n            <li><strong><span class=\"nav-arrow\">&gt;</span> Accessibility</strong></li>\n            <li>Design for developers</li>\n            <li>Version control</li>\n            \n            <li class=\"section-title\">Extension modules</li>\n            <li><span class=\"nav-arrow\">&gt;</span> Advanced JavaScript objects</li>\n            <li><span class=\"nav-arrow\">&gt;</span> Client-side web APIs</li>\n            <li><span class=\"nav-arrow\">&gt;</span> Asynchronous JavaScript</li>\n            <li style=\"flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start;\">\n                <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center;\"><strong><span class=\"nav-arrow\">&#8964;</span> Web forms</strong></div>\n                <ul class=\"sub-list\">\n                    <li>Your first form</li>\n                    <li>How to structure a web form</li>\n                    <li>Basic native form controls</li>\n                    <li>The HTML5 input types</li>\n                    <li>Other form controls</li>\n                    <li>Styling web forms</li>\n                    <li class=\"active\">Advanced form styling</li>\n                    <li>Customizable selects</li>\n                    <li>Customizable listboxes</li>\n                    <li>UI pseudo-classes</li>\n                    <li>Client-side form validation</li>\n                    <li>Sending form data</li>\n                </ul>\n            </li>\n            <li><span class=\"nav-arrow\">&gt;</span> Additional tutorials</li>\n            <li><strong><span class=\"nav-arrow\">&gt;</span> Understanding client-side tools</strong></li>\n            <li><strong><span class=\"nav-arrow\">&gt;</span> Server-side websites</strong></li>\n            <li><strong><span class=\"nav-arrow\">&gt;</span> Web performance</strong></li>\n            <li><strong><span class=\"nav-arrow\">&gt;</span> Testing</strong></li>\n            \n            <li class=\"section-title\">Further resources</li>\n            <li><span class=\"nav-arrow\">&gt;</span> How to solve common problems</li>\n            <li>About</li>\n            <li>Resources for educators</li>\n        </ul>\n    </aside>\n\n    <main class=\"content\">\n        <h1>Advanced form styling</h1>\n        \n        <div class=\"article-nav\">\n            <a href=\"#\">&larr; Previous</a>\n            <a href=\"#\">Overview: Web forms</a>\n            <a href=\"#\">Next &rarr;</a>\n        </div>\n        \n        <p>In this article, we will see what can be done with CSS to style the types of form control that are more difficult to style — the \"bad\" and \"ugly\" categories. As we saw <a href=\"#\" class=\"link\">in the previous article</a>, text fields and buttons are perfectly easy to style; now we will dig into styling the more problematic bits.</p>\n        \n        <table class=\"info-table\">\n            <tr>\n                <th>Prerequisites:</th>\n                <td>A basic understanding of <a href=\"#\" class=\"link\">HTML</a> and <a href=\"#\" class=\"link\">CSS</a>.</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <th>Objective:</th>\n                <td>To understand what parts of forms are hard to style, and why; to learn what can be done to customize them.</td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n\n        <p>To recap what we said in the previous article, we have:</p>\n        \n        <p><strong>The bad:</strong> Some elements are more difficult to style, requiring more complex CSS or some more specific tricks:</p>\n        <ul>\n            <li>Checkboxes and radio buttons</li>\n            <li><a href=\"#\"><code>&lt;input type=\"search\"&gt;</code></a></li>\n        </ul>\n        \n        <p><strong>The ugly:</strong> Some elements can't be styled thoroughly using CSS. These include:</p>\n        <ul>\n            <li>Elements involved in creating dropdown widgets, including <a href=\"#\"><code>&lt;select&gt;</code></a>, <a href=\"#\"><code>&lt;option&gt;</code></a>, <a href=\"#\"><code>&lt;optgroup&gt;</code></a> and <a href=\"#\"><code>&lt;datalist&gt;</code></a>.\n                <div class=\"note-box\">\n                    <span class=\"note-icon\">&#9432;</span>\n                    <div>\n                        <strong>Note:</strong> Some browsers now support <a href=\"#\" class=\"link\">Customizable select elements</a>, a set of HTML and CSS features that together enable full customization of <code>&lt;select&gt;</code> elements and their contents just like any regular DOM elements.\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </li>\n            <li><a href=\"#\"><code>&lt;input type=\"color\"&gt;</code></a></li>\n            <li>Date-related controls such as <a href=\"#\"><code>&lt;input type=\"datetime-local\"&gt;</code></a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"#\"><code>&lt;input type=\"range\"&gt;</code></a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"#\"><code>&lt;input type=\"file\"&gt;</code></a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"#\"><code>&lt;progress&gt;</code></a> and <a href=\"#\"><code>&lt;meter&gt;</code></a></li>\n        </ul>\n\n        <p>Let's first talk about the <a href=\"#\" class=\"link\"><code>appearance</code></a> property, which is useful for making all of the above more stylable.</p>\n\n        <h2><code>appearance</code>: controlling OS-level styling</h2>\n        \n        <p>In the previous article, we mentioned that historically, the styling of web form controls was largely derived from the underlying operating system, which is part of the reason for the difficulty in customizing the look of these controls.</p>\n        \n        <p>The <a href=\"#\" class=\"link\"><code>appearance</code></a> property was created as a way to control what OS- or system-level styling was applied to web form controls. By far the most helpful value, and probably the only one you'll use, is <code>none</code>. This stops any control you apply it to from using system-level styling, as much as possible, and lets you build up the styles yourself using CSS.</p>\n        \n        <p>For example, let's take the following controls:</p>\n    </main>\n\n    <aside class=\"right-sidebar\">\n        <h3>In this article</h3>\n        <ul class=\"toc-list\">\n            <li class=\"active\">appearance: controlling OS-level styling</li>\n            <li>What can be done about the \"ugly\" elements?</li>\n            <li>Summary</li>\n        </ul>\n        \n        <div class=\"ad-box\">\n            <div class=\"ad-badge-small\">AD</div>\n            <div class=\"ad-logo\">imagekit.io</div>\n            <div class=\"ad-text\">\n                <strong>Image &amp; Video API</strong><br>\n                Real-time URL transforms, global CDN delivery &amp; easy integration with existing storage.\n            </div>\n            <button class=\"ad-btn\">Start Free &#8599;</button>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ad-link-small\"><a href=\"#\">Don't want to see ads?</a></div>\n    </aside>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
